Why: A Notepad launch refused because the user has a Notepad window open says that this is a lasting limitation of Windows Notepad, not a temporary failure: Notepad opens every file as a tab in a window it already shows and has no way to open one in a window of its own, so a retry is refused the same way while that window is open. When that window is the user's front window, the refusal says so.

